# Claude Agent Monitor — environment template
#
# This app requires NO environment variables. The dev server, projects/teams
# paths, and all tunables are compiled in:
#   - `npm run dev` binds 0.0.0.0:4000 (see the `dev` script in package.json)
#   - JSONL discovery roots are ~/.claude/projects and ~/.claude/teams
#     (hard-coded in scripts/lib/config.ts)
#   - The route-handler origin allowlist lives in scripts/lib/origin-check.ts
#
# This file is intentionally empty of variables. Nothing here is read at runtime.
